(text "Nominal VBAT = ADC_V * 8.222222 (includes R303; Ron and ADC loading not included).\nADC off leakage discharges through R303. POWER_GOOD enables switch and I2C together.\nWait >= 150 ms after enable before measurement. Sense ground must not carry motor return current." (at 20 263 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 862b27bf-74f1-52ee-a133-ba5ef2d25032)))
